# Agent worktrees. Transient checkouts of this same repo — committing them would nest the
# repository inside itself.
.claude/worktrees/

# MCP server config — holds a Supabase personal access token inline.
# Ignored rather than checked in: the remote is public, and `git add .` would
# publish the token. If the token ever moves to ${SUPABASE_ACCESS_TOKEN}
# expansion, this line can go and the file can be shared.
.mcp.json

